    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 70,
        "text": "Have you chosen an activity for the leisure club day next month?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bd6f26a3a0b963767f160291b366fe2bee2f082e3cbf535291b5d872c9642508",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 77,
        "sourceEnd": 235,
        "text": "Not yet. I want a hobby I can share with my brother, but our fitness levels are different. He is a keen athlete, and I have only recently started to exercise.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "16962d379f69efa5c417f046e2cf0a2685f3d239b451adeb22cd437675e26c82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 242,
        "sourceEnd": 279,
        "text": "Have you ever played tennis together?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "59d8b034a694e70f41bc24ce8cda189983f1d5911a4e902ae679fd0c0a6c9c39",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 286,
        "sourceEnd": 415,
        "text": "Yes, we have. We borrowed a racket each from the center last year, and I enjoyed it. He wants to try a different sport this time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "41e85f6cf92df6015ab5710fe13c507293812a4f8a542a2c6d8f67d383aa43a2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 422,
        "sourceEnd": 542,
        "text": "The gym has a beginner volleyball session at ten. Its coach says no experience is needed, and the equipment is included.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ccede24083a148ec113d9874ff151c6dafd2a25d57ac86fb64fff40903f0259a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 549,
        "sourceEnd": 668,
        "text": "That sounds good. My brother has already tried basketball, but I have never played volleyball. We could learn together.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b96dd0a5b0aa9397327ac807527f8e85f2c7dec9a8aee6b6ac0eb77a3f182e46",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 675,
        "sourceEnd": 792,
        "text": "There is also an aerobics class at twelve, followed by yoga at two. Both are indoors, so the weather will not matter.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b395661fa891b1e954cf5bf5ac3262d51b200a7d43785432c2ba9acc870f16ad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 799,
        "sourceEnd": 915,
        "text": "I enjoy music, but my brother prefers a game with a ball. Let's book the ten o'clock session. How much does it cost?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7d36c6c346683d7b0e9ec95a8b8fed81afb405de6b16ffd1b49705a14dad3085",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 922,
        "sourceEnd": 1023,
        "text": "Six dollars for each person. The center asks visitors to book by Thursday, because the room is small.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "91ff62557932d7b6ee622042d36aa73bf380d7608e0fe1079727fc3df68dcebd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 1030,
        "sourceEnd": 1116,
        "text": "I will tell him tonight. Could we cycle there? He has a bicycle, and I can borrow one.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "38c912a7f741a5d4d83d474c3691ef4bc416fd15184fb754e37932bd9099f156",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 1123,
        "sourceEnd": 1261,
        "text": "Yes, and please wear a helmet. You can leave the bikes next to the front door. There is also a place to jog or hike in the park afterward.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "631113ec7c6dcea26d78eb790d329c67960115b7cef64b37d31973f69b4c8951",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 1268,
        "sourceEnd": 1368,
        "text": "Is there a competition at the stadium that day too? I would like to watch a match after our session.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a290a958fba390791d7cf6bc7396b13348c8065b9e5223f0df36fd389eb85167",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 1375,
        "sourceEnd": 1487,
        "text": "Yes. The first game begins at four. You can be a spectator without paying, and the coach will explain the score.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cc19f96933302d55549dc96cee082957a07bd41c1caeb437b52ed1267ae84301",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "rosa",
        "speaker": "Rosa",
        "sourceStart": 1494,
        "sourceEnd": 1599,
        "text": "Great. I do not mind who will win or lose. It will be fun to see how each opponent works with their team.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ddac81bb3cf84d8b8c18d9569d3deddf0106793c281a218fab9c4e93d10b58db",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "liam",
        "speaker": "Liam",
        "sourceStart": 1606,
        "sourceEnd": 1696,
        "text": "The winner gets a small cup, but nobody has to be a champion to join the morning sessions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bf095e456e9da67c1cbf94b466d31dc44a90746a76124408010cfcece182119d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
